module Core

### Suflae SF-realm Core list — roam-boundary wrapper over a bare RF::Core.List[T].
### Only the entity + constructor are hand-written; every other method is auto-forwarded to `inner`
### by SynthesizeSuflaeForwarders (StdlibLoader.SuflaeForwarders).
entity List[T]
  secret inner: RF::Core.List[T]

routine List[T]() -> List[T]
  return List[T](inner: RF::Core.List[T]())
